WEBVTT

00:04.540 --> 00:07.860
<b>Sorry, but this restroom
is exclusive to employees.</b>

00:10.550 --> 00:11.310
<b>Um...</b>

00:11.310 --> 00:14.340
<b>Oh, seems like your wish will come true.</b>

00:15.350 --> 00:18.500
<b>Could I borrow your power?</b>

02:05.380 --> 02:07.610
<b>We have successfully recovered Verde's id.</b>

02:08.000 --> 02:11.050
<b>Naomi Orthmann and Rouge Redstar...</b>

02:11.050 --> 02:15.280
<b>They have completed their mission on Mars,
and will return to Earth in two days.</b>

02:15.280 --> 02:15.970
<b>Thank you.</b>

02:24.790 --> 02:26.380
<b>Chairman Yunghart.</b>

02:29.720 --> 02:30.960
<b>May I have a moment?</b>

02:32.770 --> 02:36.720
<b>Feels like the sky is seeing
through us from above, no?</b>

02:38.210 --> 02:41.060
<b>The visitors... Xe Noah, eh?</b>

02:41.500 --> 02:43.430
<b>They're not even gods, anyway.</b>

02:44.990 --> 02:47.000
<b>Oh, this is quite the beverage.</b>

02:47.600 --> 02:50.780
<b>I feel like you're seeing right through me.</b>

02:50.780 --> 02:51.810
<b>Chief Chau.</b>

02:52.640 --> 02:56.700
<b>I became what I am right now
because I believed in my subordinates.</b>

02:57.300 --> 03:01.340
<b>No matter what you are doing behind me,
I will still believe in you.</b>

03:01.720 --> 03:05.620
<b>Our problem is the outside interference
from the Ministry of Truth.</b>

03:06.430 --> 03:08.990
<b>Seems like there is a mole in our division.</b>

03:08.990 --> 03:10.630
<b>I have received such reports.</b>

03:11.220 --> 03:12.920
<b>An agent from the Protection Bureau?</b>

03:13.560 --> 03:17.740
<b>Please, don't get personal,
even with your secrets you can't tell me.</b>

03:29.010 --> 03:32.570
<b>Master, is your leg feeling better?</b>

03:32.900 --> 03:34.820
<b>Just as you can see,
I'm feeling better!</b>

03:34.820 --> 03:38.450
<b>I should spread my wings
at the dance hall tonight.</b>

03:42.270 --> 03:44.440
<b>Oh, the boy next door!</b>

03:44.440 --> 03:46.520
<b>Oh, the lady next door.</b>

03:46.520 --> 03:47.370
<b>Where are you going?</b>

03:47.640 --> 03:48.620
<b>The pool.</b>

03:48.620 --> 03:52.930
<b>My body is getting dull after
spending two weeks on a ship.</b>

03:52.930 --> 03:55.000
<b>Are you coming with us, Aes?</b>

03:55.000 --> 03:56.770
<b>I can't swim.</b>

03:56.770 --> 03:59.690
<b>Besides, I have to return
these books to the library.</b>

03:59.690 --> 04:02.500
<b>So these are the rumoured paper books.</b>

04:02.500 --> 04:03.850
<b>Now that you mentioned it,</b>

04:03.850 --> 04:06.640
<b>I heard you can experience
the good old-fashioned Earth here?</b>

04:06.970 --> 04:09.760
<b>I love the smell of paper.</b>

04:12.760 --> 04:13.720
<b>Stinks!</b>

04:16.600 --> 04:18.320
<b>But I don't hate it.</b>

04:18.320 --> 04:19.290
<b>Right?</b>

04:20.890 --> 04:23.080
<b>Only two days before we reach Earth...</b>

04:23.080 --> 04:25.330
<b>- You have a wife waiting, right?
- Yeah.</b>

04:30.630 --> 04:32.500
<b>Are you free...</b>

04:32.960 --> 04:34.660
<b>Rouge Redstar?</b>

04:35.240 --> 04:37.010
<b>Are you free...</b>

04:37.370 --> 04:39.210
<b>Rouge Redstar?</b>

04:40.880 --> 04:41.940
<b>Rouge?</b>

04:42.440 --> 04:46.340
<b>The masked man who called
himself a puppeteer...</b>

04:46.340 --> 04:48.680
<b>He came back in my dream.</b>

04:49.320 --> 04:51.440
<b>Dream? What kind?</b>

04:51.930 --> 04:54.540
<b>Felt so nostalgic somehow...</b>

04:54.540 --> 04:58.240
<b>Someone I should know
but didn't was by my side...</b>

05:00.460 --> 05:02.410
<b>I couldn't remember it clearly...</b>

05:02.740 --> 05:04.540
<b>Who was that person?</b>

05:05.740 --> 05:06.160
<b>Oh?</b>

05:08.440 --> 05:09.580
<b>Aes?</b>

05:16.820 --> 05:18.760
<b>That was great, Aes.</b>

05:18.760 --> 05:20.130
<b>Didn't you say you can't swim?</b>

05:20.920 --> 05:23.640
<b>I'm getting murderous
if people mistake me for Aes.</b>

05:23.940 --> 05:24.690
<b>Oh...</b>

05:24.690 --> 05:26.720
<b>Could you be Aes' twin sibling?</b>

05:26.720 --> 05:29.480
<b>Name's Alice.
You're Rouge and Naomi, right?</b>

05:29.960 --> 05:34.080
<b>Aes said there's a pair
of beautiful girls staying next door.</b>

05:34.080 --> 05:36.080
<b>That's quite nice of him.</b>

05:36.080 --> 05:37.800
<b>The "beautiful" part
was out of the line.</b>

05:37.800 --> 05:40.530
<b>I think you're more like
a "not-so-ugly" pair.</b>

05:41.230 --> 05:44.370
<b>Aes must've had
some dumplings stuck in his eyes.</b>

05:44.370 --> 05:46.360
<b>His aesthetic sense is weird.</b>

05:48.200 --> 05:49.820
<b>Not-so-ugly...</b>

05:49.820 --> 05:51.240
<b>Pair...</b>

05:53.120 --> 05:55.470
<b>After all our trip to Mars...</b>

05:55.470 --> 05:57.680
<b>We have to return to Earth this quick?</b>

05:57.680 --> 06:01.140
<b>It is what it is.
We must obey the orders.</b>

06:01.720 --> 06:04.000
<b>The red guy was on Mars.</b>

06:04.000 --> 06:07.810
<b>Not to mention,
the black guy I never saw as well...</b>

06:09.220 --> 06:12.640
<b>Those Ministry guys...
What are they hiding?</b>

06:18.890 --> 06:20.040
<b>Hey!</b>

06:29.750 --> 06:30.570
<b>Noid!</b>

06:42.690 --> 06:43.590
<b>No way...</b>

06:45.630 --> 06:47.600
<b>A homicide has just occurred.</b>

06:48.040 --> 06:49.970
<b>Homicide? Someone got killed?</b>

06:49.970 --> 06:52.600
<b>The killer is Reggie Avan, 38.</b>

06:52.600 --> 06:55.350
<b>178 cm, 68 kg.</b>

06:55.350 --> 06:57.980
<b>Blonde white guy, still at large.</b>

06:58.760 --> 07:00.950
<b>Unless confirmed safe, passengers...</b>

07:00.950 --> 07:03.610
<b>...are to remain inside their suites.</b>

07:03.610 --> 07:05.240
<b>What do we do?</b>

07:05.620 --> 07:06.510
<b>No helping it.</b>

07:13.080 --> 07:15.560
<b>Let go! What did I do to deserve this?!</b>

07:15.560 --> 07:17.000
<b>Reggie Avan.</b>

07:17.000 --> 07:20.250
<b>You are under arrest for
the murder of Mark Johnson.</b>

07:20.250 --> 07:20.930
<b>Huh?</b>

07:21.440 --> 07:22.650
<b>Mark died?</b>

07:23.160 --> 07:24.010
<b>You're kidding me.</b>

07:24.010 --> 07:25.590
<b>You killed him, didn't you?</b>

07:26.150 --> 07:28.430
<b>Why would I kill him?</b>

07:28.430 --> 07:31.030
<b>I was at the casino
till you dragged me here!</b>

07:31.490 --> 07:32.430
<b>I'm not lying!</b>

07:32.730 --> 07:36.190
<b>I've been losing some
2,000 credits since morning!</b>

07:36.610 --> 07:38.590
<b>The security footage
at the time of murder.</b>

07:39.190 --> 07:40.690
<b>What does this mean?</b>

07:41.040 --> 07:42.110
<b>At the same time,</b>

07:42.110 --> 07:45.900
<b>one person was at two different places,
that's all we can draw from this.</b>

07:47.620 --> 07:50.320
<b>They said someone was killed.
Scary!</b>

07:50.320 --> 07:54.420
<b>The hospitality staff are also told
to stay inside their rooms after this.</b>

07:54.420 --> 07:57.040
<b>It sure is scary.</b>

08:02.690 --> 08:04.740
<b>That woman is a witness.</b>

08:07.880 --> 08:10.080
<b>Since you are a witness,</b>

08:10.080 --> 08:12.800
<b>you are obligated to help
with our investigation...</b>

08:19.130 --> 08:20.390
<b>Can you talk now?</b>

08:23.760 --> 08:25.170
<b>You saw the culprit, right?</b>

08:25.690 --> 08:27.630
<b>They had the same face as Cecil?</b>

08:28.040 --> 08:28.760
<b>Yeah.</b>

08:29.540 --> 08:30.710
<b>But it wasn't her...</b>

08:31.220 --> 08:32.610
<b>They had the same face,</b>

08:33.050 --> 08:34.740
<b>but that wasn't Cecil!</b>

08:35.300 --> 08:36.620
<b>Why do you think so?</b>

08:37.310 --> 08:38.680
<b>They smirked.</b>

08:38.680 --> 08:39.710
<b>Smirked?</b>

08:40.670 --> 08:43.830
<b>In a very creepy way...</b>

08:44.500 --> 08:46.630
<b>That can't be Cecil!</b>

08:53.220 --> 08:54.760
<b>Yum!</b>

08:54.760 --> 08:57.020
<b>Shouldn't we be in our suite?</b>

08:57.490 --> 09:00.340
<b>We'll have countless days
of labour waiting on Earth,</b>

09:00.340 --> 09:03.040
<b>so to hell with cooping up indoors!</b>

09:05.160 --> 09:07.290
<b>Can you really be out here?</b>

09:08.650 --> 09:09.280
<b>Oh?</b>

09:09.640 --> 09:12.280
<b>Aes? Alice?</b>

09:12.280 --> 09:13.810
<b>So you met Alice?</b>

09:13.810 --> 09:16.830
<b>It's you, Aes.
You two really do look alike.</b>

09:16.830 --> 09:19.120
<b>No way, we don't.</b>

09:19.120 --> 09:21.040
<b>So what are you doing here?</b>

09:21.430 --> 09:25.360
<b>We won't be able to leave my room
for a while since there's a homicide,</b>

09:25.360 --> 09:27.550
<b>so Alice told me to buy some food.</b>

09:27.550 --> 09:29.480
<b>What am I, her servant?</b>

09:30.990 --> 09:33.440
<b>What do you mean
the movie's cancelled?</b>

09:33.820 --> 09:35.380
<b>We told you, there's an incident...</b>

09:35.380 --> 09:38.100
<b>Can't you see this sturdy
Nean I have here?</b>

09:38.420 --> 09:41.510
<b>He's my bodyguard,
so who cares about a killer at large!</b>

09:41.510 --> 09:44.190
<b>I pay high for this!</b>

09:44.190 --> 09:48.720
<b>Whoa, isn't the guy complaining
the one on the bus?</b>

09:48.720 --> 09:50.590
<b>So he is aboard as well.</b>

09:50.590 --> 09:53.080
<b>I'd rather meet with the killer than him.</b>

09:53.080 --> 09:55.850
<b>We can't just send you back alone,</b>

09:56.250 --> 09:58.100
<b>so what say you stick with us?</b>

09:59.370 --> 10:02.370
<b>Tell Alice we said hi.
Don't leave your room, okay?</b>

10:02.370 --> 10:03.930
<b>Yeah. Later.</b>

10:05.880 --> 10:08.800
<b>Can't believe we meet again here.</b>

10:09.220 --> 10:10.670
<b>So you're from the Ministry, too?</b>

10:11.000 --> 10:12.780
<b>Err...</b>

10:12.780 --> 10:17.830
<b>Yep! We just finished our mission,
and are now on super vacation!</b>

10:17.830 --> 10:19.100
<b>You need something?</b>

10:19.410 --> 10:20.290
<b>Yes, we do.</b>

10:20.290 --> 10:21.030
<b>Huh?</b>

10:21.880 --> 10:23.480
<b>Naomi Orthmann.</b>

10:23.910 --> 10:26.680
<b>You are under arrest for a murder.</b>

10:31.770 --> 10:33.740
<b>Wha...</b>

10:33.740 --> 10:35.940
<b>What the heck?!</b>

10:35.940 --> 10:39.010
<b>It's similar to the other scenes so far.</b>

10:39.010 --> 10:42.740
<b>The footage is always cut off from
this point, and we can't track them.</b>

10:43.130 --> 10:46.860
<b>A look-alike... A doppelganger, I suppose.</b>

10:46.860 --> 10:48.450
<b>What's that?</b>

10:48.450 --> 10:49.710
<b>Shut up.</b>

10:50.100 --> 10:53.350
<b>Well, this is safety precautions,
I guess. Please excuse me.</b>

10:54.220 --> 10:57.350
<b>There are two Naomis...
Which one is the real one?</b>

10:57.350 --> 11:00.220
<b>The one who's been by your
side since forever, duh!</b>

11:00.220 --> 11:02.880
<b>What kind of sick joke is this?</b>

11:02.880 --> 11:04.960
<b>Truth be told, I have no idea.</b>

11:04.960 --> 11:07.860
<b>Then you must have an idea
how to get these cuffs off!</b>

11:07.860 --> 11:11.080
<b>The Ministry guys aren't trustworthy.</b>

11:11.080 --> 11:12.850
<b>I made a deal with someone...</b>

11:12.850 --> 11:15.920
<b>...to have her share
intel on the red guy,</b>

11:15.920 --> 11:18.090
<b>but she bailed on me.</b>

11:19.370 --> 11:24.120
<b>When this case is solved,
I have mountains of questions for you.</b>

11:25.210 --> 11:26.120
<b>Hm?</b>

11:26.750 --> 11:29.380
<b>Come and find me...</b>

11:30.410 --> 11:31.540
<b>...if you can?</b>

11:50.700 --> 11:53.100
<b>Jaron of the Underworld is onboard.</b>

11:53.100 --> 11:54.400
<b>Figures.</b>

11:54.750 --> 11:57.620
<b>There's no mistaking it.
This serial murder case...</b>

11:57.620 --> 11:59.780
<b>...is a killing game Jaron set up.</b>

12:00.130 --> 12:02.530
<b>If we play the game,
it'll be according to his plan.</b>

12:03.060 --> 12:04.440
<b>Our mission...</b>

12:04.440 --> 12:08.590
<b>...is a top secret one
that even Chief Chau doesn't know.</b>

12:08.590 --> 12:09.670
<b>But...</b>

12:09.670 --> 12:11.730
<b>We're almost on Earth.</b>

12:11.730 --> 12:14.200
<b>It's part of our mission
to not get involved,</b>

12:14.200 --> 12:17.170
<b>cause a scene, or stand out,
and return safely.</b>

12:17.570 --> 12:21.190
<b>The excellent Protection Bureau
guy will do something</b>

12:21.190 --> 12:22.540
<b>so just sit back at your room...</b>

12:22.540 --> 12:23.510
<b>I don't want to!</b>

12:23.510 --> 12:24.090
<b>Wha...</b>

12:24.720 --> 12:28.290
<b>I hate that you're accused
of being a murderer,</b>

12:28.290 --> 12:31.180
<b>and he just keeps on killing
people as I do nothing...</b>

12:31.180 --> 12:33.820
<b>No way I'll sit back and take it easy!</b>

12:39.830 --> 12:43.990
<b>The body of the ship's crew
was found in the airport.</b>

12:43.990 --> 12:45.350
<b>Any ID?</b>

12:45.350 --> 12:49.250
<b>Err... The victim was Rob Acres.</b>

12:49.250 --> 12:53.210
<b>We've been asked to investigate
by the Mars Terminal Police.</b>

12:53.210 --> 12:55.250
<b>This must be a mistake.</b>

12:55.730 --> 12:59.460
<b>He's been serving onboard
as the room clerk since departure.</b>

12:59.870 --> 13:01.680
<b>He can't be a ghost.</b>

13:01.680 --> 13:05.010
<b>Right. I also met with him recently.</b>

13:05.010 --> 13:08.010
<b>He was the closest one
to the first scene of crime.</b>

13:08.500 --> 13:10.350
<b>Give me Acres' current location.</b>

13:10.350 --> 13:13.350
<b>Rob Acres' location cannot be tracked...</b>

13:13.350 --> 13:15.440
<b>...since 2 minutes and 32 seconds ago.</b>

13:16.070 --> 13:17.690
<b>Is he really a ghost?</b>

13:17.970 --> 13:20.430
<b>No way... But...</b>

13:20.970 --> 13:22.350
<b>Aside from that...</b>

13:27.250 --> 13:28.160
<b>Huh?</b>

13:28.590 --> 13:30.030
<b>Ash, take a look at this.</b>

13:31.210 --> 13:32.960
<b>This is live footage.</b>

13:40.340 --> 13:42.460
<b>Now you're showing off before committing!</b>

13:43.880 --> 13:45.310
<b>Freeze!</b>

13:47.550 --> 13:48.330
<b>Noid!</b>

13:49.000 --> 13:52.850
<b>Look for Acres' weight information
when he boarded this ship!</b>

13:54.710 --> 13:57.160
<b>He's in the library,
using my face!</b>

14:05.850 --> 14:09.300
<b>Wait, wait! I'm the real one!</b>

14:09.300 --> 14:10.410
<b>Here.</b>

14:14.740 --> 14:18.010
<b>Um... Excuse me.</b>

14:20.120 --> 14:22.740
<b>Maybe Jaron's already done
the deed and turned into her?</b>

14:22.740 --> 14:24.560
<b>The possibilities aren't zero.</b>

14:24.560 --> 14:25.760
<b>Wanna kill her?</b>

14:27.490 --> 14:29.100
<b>Oh, you two.</b>

14:30.060 --> 14:33.020
<b>Sorry. When I want some quiet peace,</b>

14:33.020 --> 14:34.600
<b>I turn off my hearing aid.</b>

14:34.980 --> 14:37.890
<b>It's a way to escape from
my annoying husband.</b>

14:37.890 --> 14:39.110
<b>Please keep it a secret.</b>

14:40.670 --> 14:42.060
<b>She's the real deal...</b>

14:45.910 --> 14:48.320
<b>I won't stop smoking for real...</b>

14:48.320 --> 14:49.560
<b>Inspector Ash!</b>

14:50.530 --> 14:51.950
<b>We have another case!</b>

15:01.860 --> 15:03.480
<b>That's more like it.</b>

15:07.210 --> 15:09.920
<b>Rouge feels like playing now!</b>

15:16.050 --> 15:17.710
<b>What's wrong, Ash?</b>

15:19.090 --> 15:20.360
<b>Hold right here.</b>

15:20.800 --> 15:22.920
<b>Send a relief squad
in front of the library now!</b>

15:25.550 --> 15:27.490
<b>Don't mind me, just go!</b>

15:30.340 --> 15:31.410
<b>You...</b>

15:31.860 --> 15:32.610
<b>Thanks.</b>

15:32.610 --> 15:34.650
<b>Wait, you...</b>

15:36.020 --> 15:37.330
<b>Goddamn...</b>

15:37.880 --> 15:39.920
<b>This is why I hate the Ministry...</b>

15:43.540 --> 15:44.260
<b>Naomi!</b>

15:45.250 --> 15:46.470
<b>Just fire already!</b>

15:47.040 --> 15:48.840
<b>Which one is which, anyway?!</b>

15:48.840 --> 15:50.180
<b>You should be able to tell!</b>

15:51.480 --> 15:54.680
<b>Fine, let's have a Rouge quiz,
first to answer wins!</b>

15:55.080 --> 15:59.000
<b>Question: 7+7/7+7x7-7=?</b>

15:59.000 --> 15:59.860
<b>50!</b>

16:00.370 --> 16:01.610
<b>But why?!</b>

16:09.840 --> 16:11.120
<b>How could you tell?</b>

16:11.120 --> 16:13.170
<b>Rouge isn't that smart.</b>

16:13.170 --> 16:16.590
<b>7+7/7+7x7-7=?</b>

16:16.590 --> 16:17.920
<b>Who cares?!</b>

16:19.250 --> 16:20.290
<b>Gotcha!</b>

16:24.480 --> 16:25.870
<b>We're from the Ministry of Truth!</b>

16:25.870 --> 16:28.970
<b>We'll be cooperating wholly
with the investigation now!</b>

16:28.970 --> 16:30.060
<b>Let's get along.</b>

16:30.700 --> 16:32.420
<b>Have you found out the culprit's weight?</b>

16:32.420 --> 16:34.850
<b>We've investigated it
by the orders from the inspector.</b>

16:35.420 --> 16:37.330
<b>That old man sure got the brains.</b>

16:38.430 --> 16:41.740
<b>Rob Acres, 26, 182 cm.</b>

16:41.740 --> 16:44.480
<b>His weight was 82.2 kg
when boarding the ship.</b>

16:44.980 --> 16:47.600
<b>Gather all people weighting
82.2 kg in one place,</b>

16:47.600 --> 16:50.060
<b>and seal off the surroundings!</b>

16:54.020 --> 16:56.570
<b>You two again?!</b>

16:56.570 --> 16:59.620
<b>There's a serial murderer among you all.</b>

16:59.620 --> 17:01.020
<b>For investigation...</b>

17:01.020 --> 17:03.290
<b>I'll be punching everyone, one by one!</b>

17:03.290 --> 17:04.290
<b>Huh?</b>

17:04.290 --> 17:05.440
<b>For what?</b>

17:05.440 --> 17:08.460
<b>The person who can withstand my punch
is Jaron of the Underworld.</b>

17:09.150 --> 17:11.160
<b>They'll die if they can't take it,
you know?</b>

17:11.160 --> 17:13.540
<b>I can hold back, you know...</b>

17:13.540 --> 17:15.310
<b>This is the fastest way.</b>

17:15.310 --> 17:17.430
<b>Why do we have to be punched?</b>

17:18.780 --> 17:20.020
<b>Excuse me!</b>

17:31.260 --> 17:33.730
<b>Cut it out, you woman!</b>

17:33.730 --> 17:36.030
<b>No one will marry you...</b>

17:40.120 --> 17:42.510
<b>This guy weights 82.2 kg?</b>

17:42.510 --> 17:45.960
<b>He's the owner,
and the one weighting 82.2 kg is...</b>

17:47.010 --> 17:48.960
<b>Are you going to hit Rubens?!</b>

17:55.100 --> 17:56.480
<b>Rubens!</b>

17:56.480 --> 17:58.680
<b>How cruel! You must be the murderer!</b>

17:58.680 --> 18:01.360
<b>How could you kick
such an innocent dog?!</b>

18:03.590 --> 18:04.600
<b>Rubens?</b>

18:04.600 --> 18:06.980
<b>Enough pretending as a weak dog...</b>

18:07.270 --> 18:07.990
<b>Jaron.</b>

18:08.620 --> 18:11.080
<b>You really are an interesting fellow.</b>

18:11.080 --> 18:12.950
<b>You're even way more interesting!</b>

18:26.840 --> 18:30.560
<b>Now... Come this way.</b>

18:34.910 --> 18:36.460
<b>You can't, Ash!</b>

18:38.890 --> 18:42.270
<b>I've been wanting to kill you!</b>

18:44.360 --> 18:47.650
<b>As I was savouring
the thrill of the possibility...</b>

18:47.650 --> 18:51.170
<b>...of being killed by something that has
the same strength as me, with this hand...</b>

18:51.170 --> 18:52.860
<b>Ahh...</b>

18:54.360 --> 18:58.030
<b>It really is true that
one's wish will come true!</b>

18:58.490 --> 19:00.370
<b>Whatever you say!</b>

19:13.970 --> 19:16.640
<b>Your attacks are but simple.</b>

19:17.040 --> 19:20.590
<b>I have been reading them all the time!</b>

19:21.300 --> 19:23.430
<b>I won't listen to what a murderer has to say!</b>

19:23.960 --> 19:26.870
<b>Are you sure you want to
act tough like that?</b>

19:26.870 --> 19:30.690
<b>You cannot avenge your parent like that.</b>

19:30.690 --> 19:31.940
<b>What are you talking about?!</b>

19:32.230 --> 19:33.570
<b>Exactly what I said.</b>

19:34.780 --> 19:36.530
<b>I knew it was you!</b>

19:36.530 --> 19:38.030
<b>So you did it?!</b>

19:38.030 --> 19:43.060
<b>Ping-pong! I am the one who killed
your father, Professor Roy Yunghart,</b>

19:43.060 --> 19:45.540
<b>using your identity and form!</b>

19:45.540 --> 19:47.580
<b>This Jaron did!</b>

19:47.580 --> 19:50.140
<b>Then face the consequences!</b>

19:50.790 --> 19:52.950
<b>See, you're getting fired up right away.</b>

19:56.840 --> 19:59.090
<b>That's one of your bad habits!</b>

20:14.140 --> 20:18.620
<b>Adieu, Rouge!</b>

20:21.940 --> 20:25.500
<b>A dirty shooting star is descending into hell.</b>

20:26.090 --> 20:27.350
<b>What a story.</b>

20:44.900 --> 20:48.560
<b>Captain, we have orders from
the patrol ship to stop sailing.</b>

20:56.240 --> 20:58.770
<b>Geez, where have you been?</b>

21:02.070 --> 21:03.160
<b>Nice work.</b>

21:04.390 --> 21:05.610
<b>Who are they?</b>

21:06.140 --> 21:08.520
<b>Protection Bureau's Artificial
Species Audit Department.</b>

21:08.520 --> 21:09.770
<b>Naomi?</b>

21:10.220 --> 21:11.690
<b>Rouge Redstar.</b>

21:12.990 --> 21:18.490
<b>You are under arrest for violating Article 5.9 of
the Artificial Species Operational Regulations.</b>
